r command when they were patient and [when] they were certain of Our signs.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"32:25","t":"Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"32:26","t":"Has it not become clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them, [as] they walk among their dwellings? Indeed in that are signs; then do they not hear?","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"32:27","t":"Have they not seen that We drive water [in clouds] to barren land and bring forth thereby crops from which their livestock eat and [they] themselves? Then do they not see?","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"32:28","t":"And they say, \"When will be this conquest, if you should be truthful?\"","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"32:29","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"On the Day of Conquest the belief of those who had disbelieved will not benefit them, nor will they be reprieved.\"","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"32:30","t":"So turn away from them and wait. Indeed, they are waiting.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":30,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":42,"surahs":[32],"sajdah":false}